    <string name="how_to_play_hint">Double-tap a cell to open it. Long-press to place or remove a flag. The first cell you open is safe.\n\nA clue counts mines directly above, below, left and right on this board, plus the same position on the layer immediately above or below. Diagonals do not count.\n\nUse the layer switch to explore the other boards. Flag all mines correctly to win.</string>
