    <string name="how_to_play_3d">Select a block, then use Open or Flag. The first actual reveal is safe. Logic, escape and daily modes begin at a fixed safe cell.\n\nDrag with one finger to orbit. Use two fingers to zoom or move the view. Arrows change decks; B1 is the highest deck. Overview shows the stack. This layer makes inner decks and corners easier to reach.\n\nA number counts the four neighbours on this deck and the same position immediately above and below: at most six. Missing cells never count. Flag every mine with no incorrect flags to win. In escape mode, open a safe route from the entrance to the exit.\n\nScan mode offers two scans of opened number cells. Hints highlight related cells before explaining the deduction. Orbiting and zooming never open cells.</string>
